On available
    Say "Marching and marching! With this momentum, we will be able to wipe them all out. Do you think Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] feels the same way?"

On offer
    Show quest "A good news! The war situation is changing favorably towards us!\n\nThe goal is to get [Devil4] Samigina. You'll be able to call out [Devil4] by using the [Devil4 Summoning Stone] located at [Eslant].\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 4 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Bros, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 4] Samigina from [Devil 4 Summoning Stone] at Luferson Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 4 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "The souls of the dead are answering to his call. Let's get rid of [4Devil] Samigina fast."

On claimable
    Show quest "The souls of the dead can sleep peacefully. Well done.\n\nThey seem confused since [Devil 4] Samigina was sealed. However, it made them to strengthen their solidarity. It was an unexpected result, but we can't stop there. We can vanquish them slowly. Your next targets are [Devil 27] Ronove, who's also called Earl of Red Mist, and [Devil 51] Balam. If their numbers decrease they'll have no choice, no matter how their solidarity is strengthened. Let's advance!"
